\" data-content=\"offense\"><h4>Offense</h4><hr /><strong>Speed</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"speed\">  <li>Land 40 ft</li>  </ul><br />  <strong>Melee</strong> gore +7 (1d8+9)<br />   <ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">  <li><strong>Space</strong> 10 ft</li>   <li><strong>Reach</strong> 5 ft</li>  </ul> <br />  <strong>Special Attacks</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"special-attacks\">  <li>stampede</li>  <li>trample</li>  </ul><br />  </div></div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"statistics\"><h4>Statistics</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"attributes\"><li><strong>Str</strong> 23</li><li><strong>Dex</strong> 10</li><li><strong>Con</strong> 17</li><li><strong>Int</strong> 2</li><li><strong>Wis</strong> 11</li><li><strong>Cha</strong> 4</li></ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\" data-content=\"base-attack\"><li><strong>Base Atk</strong>+2</li><li><strong>CMB</strong> +9</li><li><strong>CMD</strong> 19  (23 vs. trip) </li></ul><br />  <strong>Feats</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"feats\">  <li>Endurance</li>  <li>Skill Focus <ul class=\"sbcCommaList sbcParensWrappedList\">  <li>Perception</li>  </ul></li>  </ul><br />   <strong>Skills</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"skills\">  <li>Perception +9</li>  </ul>  <br />     </div>  <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"ecology\"><h4>Ecology</h4><hr />  <strong>Environment</strong>   temperate plains <br />   <strong>Organization</strong>  solitary, pair, or herd (3-30)<br />   <strong>Treasure</strong>  none   <br />  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"special-abilities\"><h4> Special Abilities </h4><hr />  <p><strong>Stampede (Ex)</strong> A stampede occurs if three or more creatures with stampede make a trample attack while remaining adjacent to each other. While stampeding, the creatures can trample foes of their size or smaller, and the trample's save DC increases by +2.    </p>  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"description\"><h4> Description </h4><hr /><div class=\"sbcPreWrap\">\nAurochs (both singular and plural) are large herd animals similar to domesticated cattle.\n\nAurochs Companions Starting Statistics: Size Medium; Speed 40 ft.; AC +1 natural armor, Attack gore (1d6); Ability Scores Str 14, Dex 12, Con 12, Int 2, Wis 11, Cha 4; Special Qualities low-light vision, scent.\n\n7th-Level Adv.: Size Large; AC +3 natural armor; Attack gore (1d8); Ability Scores Str +8, Dex -2, Con +4; Special Qualities stampede, trample.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Aurochs (CR 2)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 2 \nXP 600 \nN Large animal  \nInit +0; Senses low-light vision, scent; Perception +9   \nDefense   \nAC 13, touch 9, flat-footed 13 (+4 natural, -1 size)\n\nhp 22 (3d8+9)\n\nFort +6, Ref +3, Will +1   \nOffense   \nSpd 40 ft. \nMelee gore +7 (1d8+9)\n\nSpace 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft. \nSpecial Attacks stampede, trample (2d6+9, DC 17)\n\n\n\nStatistics   \nStr 23, Dex 10, Con 17, Int 2, Wis 11, Cha 4 \nBase Atk +2; CMB +9; CMD 19 (23 vs. trip)\n\nFeats Endurance, Skill Focus (Perception)\n\nSkills Perception +9   \nEcology   \nEnvironment  temperate plains \nOrganization solitary, pair, or herd (3-30)\n\nTreasure none   \nSpecial abilities   \nStampede (Ex) A stampede occurs if three or more creatures with stampede make a trample attack while remaining adjacent to each other. While stampeding, the creatures can trample foes of their size or smaller, and the trample's save DC increases by +2.   \nDescription\n\nAurochs (both singular and plural) are large herd animals similar to domesticated cattle.\n\nAurochs Companions Starting Statistics: Size Medium; Speed 40 ft.; AC +1 natural armor, Attack gore (1d6); Ability Scores Str 14, Dex 12, Con 12, Int 2, Wis 11, Cha 4; Special Qualities low-light vision, scent.\n\n7th-Level Adv.: Size Large; AC +3 natural armor; Attack gore (1d8); Ability Scores Str +8, Dex -2, Con +4; Special Qualities stampede, trample.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":2},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"esc":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"fly":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"han":{"ability":"cha","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"hea":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"int":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kar":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kdu":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ken":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kge":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"khi":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"klo":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kna":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kno":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kpl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kre":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lin":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lor":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"per":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":3},"prf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"pro":{"ability":"wis","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"rid":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"sen":{"ability":"wis