l to 3/4 total Hit Dice (medium progression).</li>\n<li>Good <em>Fortitude</em> and <em>Reflex</em> saves.</li>\n<li>Skill points equal to 2 + <em>Int</em> modifier (minimum 1) per Hit Die. The following are class skills for animals: <em>Acrobatics</em>, <em>Climb</em>, <em>Fly</em>, <em>Perception</em>, <em>Stealth</em>, and <em>Swim</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Traits</h2>\n<p>An animal possesses the following traits (unless otherwise noted in a creature’s entry).</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Intelligence</em> score of 1 or 2 (no creature with an <em>Intelligence</em> score of 3 or higher can be an animal).</li>\n<li><em>Low-light vision</em>.</li>\n<li>Alignment: Always neutral.</li>\n<li>Treasure: None.</li>\n<li>Proficient with its natural weapons only. A non-combative herbivore treats its natural weapons as secondary attacks. Such attacks are made with a –5 penalty on the creature’s attack rolls, and the animal receives only 1/2 its <em>Strength</em> modifier as a damage adjustment.</li>\n<li>Proficient with no armor unless trained for war. (See <em>FAQ</em>s and <em>Handle Animal Skill</em>.)</li>\n<li>Animals breathe, eat, and sleep.</li>\n</ul>","instructions":""},"tags":[],"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"supplements":[]},"armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"size":"lg","speeds":{"land":null,"fly":null,"flyManeuverability":"","swim":null,"climb":null,"burrow":null},"creatureTypes":["animal"],"creatureSubtypes":[""],"sources":[]},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/skills/blue_29.jpg","_id":"nOf5DTel55qxe4tZ","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":112500,"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124851292,"modifiedTime":1795124854473,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"F77TVejOgyAsVGMF","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124851351,"modifiedTime":1795124854473,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/skills/blue_29.jpg","name":"Animal","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>An animal is a living, nonhuman creature, usually a vertebrate with no magical abilities and no innate capacity for language or culture. Animals usually have additional information on how they can serve as companions.</p>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<p>An animal has the following features (unless otherwise noted).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>d8 Hit Die.</li>\n<li>Base attack bonus equal to 3/4 total Hit Dice (medium progression).</li>\n<li>Good <em>Fortitude</em> and <em>Reflex</em> saves.</li>\n<li>Skill points equal to 2 + <em>Int</em> modifier (minimum 1) per Hit Die. The following are class skills for animals: <em>Acrobatics</em>, <em>Climb</em>, <em>Fly</em>, <em>Perception</em>, <em>Stealth</em>, and <em>Swim</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Traits</h2>\n<p>An animal possesses the following traits (unless otherwise noted in a creature’s entry).</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Intelligence</em> score of 1 or 2 (no creature with an <em>Intelligence</em> score of 3 or higher can be an animal).</li>\n<li><em>Low-light vision</em>.</li>\n<li>Alignment: Always neutral.</li>\n<li>Treasure: None.</li>\n<li>Proficient with its natural weapons only. A non-combative herbivore treats its natural weapons as secondary attacks. Such attacks are made with a –5 penalty on the creature’s attack rolls, and the animal receives only 1/2 its <em>Strength</em> modifier as a damage adjustment.</li>\n<li>Proficient with no armor unless trained for war. (See <em>FAQ</em>s and <em>Handle Animal Skill</em>.)</li>\n<li>Animals breathe, eat, and sleep.</li>\n</ul>","instructions":""},"tags":[],"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"classAssociations":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"animal","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"racial","level":3,"hd":8,"hp":13,"bab":"med","skillsPerLevel":2,"savingThrows":{"fort":{"value":"high"},"ref":{"value":"high"},"will":{"value":"low"}},"fc":{"hp":{"value":0},"skill":{"value":0},"alt":{"value":0,"notes":""}},"wealth":"","alignment":"","classSkills":{"acr":true,"clm":true,"fly":true,"per":true,"ste":true,"swm":true}},"type":"class","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":112500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.racial-hd.Item.WJqmmfXscPVpcISH"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"bl9GTuS9qxRShqWh","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124851680,"modifiedTime":1795124854473,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/endurance.png","name":"Endurance","system":{"description":{"value":"<i>Harsh conditions or long exertions do not easily tire you.</i><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You gain a +4 bonus on the following checks and saves: Swim checks made to resist nonlethal damage from exhaustion; Constitution checks made to continue running; Constitution checks made to avoid nonlethal damage from a forced march; Constitution checks made to hold your breath; Constitution checks made to avoid nonlethal damage from starvation or thirst; Fortitude saves made to avoid nonlethal damage from hot or cold environments; and Fortitude saves made to resist damage from suffocation.</p><p>You may sleep in light or medium armor without becoming fatigued.</p><p><strong>Normal</strong>: A character without this feat who sleeps in medium or heavier armor is fatigued the next day.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["General"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{},"sources":[{"id":"PZO1110","pages":"115, 122"}]},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":212500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.ehqx8txNRGMaNOPt"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"RiHtgoxqPzr4UCGu","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124851726,"modifiedTime":1795124854473,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/alertness.jpg","name":"Skill Focus (Perception)","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Choose a skill. You are particularly adept at that skill.</em></p><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You get a +3 bonus on all checks involving the chosen skill. If you have 10 or more ranks in that skill, this bonus increases to +6.</p><p><strong>Special</strong>: You can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, it applies to a new skill.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["General"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[{"_id":"B4Aa0Bjp","formula":"ifelse(gte(@skills.per.rank,10),6,3)","target":"skill.per","type":"untyped","operator":"add","priority":0}],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{}},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":412500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf-content.pf-feats.Item.9yua5ZlomvDj1c7D"},"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"name":"stampede","type":"attack","system":{"description":{"value":"sbc | Placeholder for Special Attacks, which in most statblocks are listed under 'Special Attacks' in the statistics block, but are described in the 'Special Abilities' block. Remove duplicates as needed!","instructions":""},"tags":[],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"scriptCalls":[],"masterwork":false,"enh":null,"proficient":false,"held":"1h","ammo":{"type":"","capacity":null,"misfire":null,"explode":null},"subType":"misc","baseTypes":[],"broken":false,"weaponGroups":[],"showInQuickbar":true,"size":"med"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/skills/yellow_36.jpg","_id":"HnyrSnr5z1oHZLCm","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":212500,"flags":{"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124852099,"modifiedTime":1795124854473,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"U9ALq8xHRUAJ9hrO","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124852292,"modifiedTime":1795124854473,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"icons/commodities/biological/foot-black-grey.webp","name":"Trample (2d6+9, DC 17)","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a full-round action, a creature with the trample ability can attempt to overrun any creature that is at least one size category smaller than itself. This works just like the overrun combat maneuver, but the trampling creature does not need to attempt a check; it merely has to move over opponents in its path. Targets of a trample take an amount of damage equal to the trampling creature’s slam damage + 1-1/2 times its Strength modifier. Targets of a trample can make an attack of opportunity, but at a –4 penalty. If a target forgoes an attack of opportunity, it can attempt a Reflex save to avoid the trampling creature and take half damage. The save DC against a creature’s trample attack is 10 + 1/2 the creature’s HD + the creature’s Strength modifier (the exact DC is given in the creature’s descriptive text). A trampling creature can only deal its trampling damage to each target once per round, no matter how many times its movement takes it over a target creature. A trampling creature can move up to twice its land speed as part of the trample.</p><p><em>Format</em>: trample (2d6+9, DC 20)</p><p><em>Location</em>: Special Attacks.</p><p><em>Usage:</em> Replace damage and DC</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Universal Monster Rules"],"actions":[{"_id":"zshy03oqaie1ul8l","actionType":"save","activation":{"type":"nonaction","unchained":{"type":"nonaction","cost":1},"cost":1},"attackName":"Trample","damage":{"parts":[{"formula":"2d6+9"}]},"img":"icons/commodities/biological/foot-black-grey.webp","name":"Use","save":{"dc":"20","type":"ref","harmless":false},"t